       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HYPOTENUSE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SIDE-A   PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 3.00.
       01 SIDE-B   PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 4.00.
       01 HYPOT    PIC 9(3)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE HYPOT = FUNCTION SQRT(SIDE-A ** 2 + SIDE-B ** 2)
           DISPLAY "Hypotenuse: " HYPOT
           STOP RUN.
